7. Distribution of orders by hour of the day
sql
select
    datepart(hour, time) as [hour],
    count(order_id) as [order_count]
from orders
group by datepart(hour, time)
order by [hour];

Insight: Orders peak at 12 PM (2,520) and 1 PM (2,455) for lunch, with a second peak around 5–6 PM (2,336 and 2,399) for dinner. Very few orders come in before 11 AM or after 10 PM.

